<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 31/AUGUST 1.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JULY 31/AUGUST 1.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Thursday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for August 1. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   01.08.97	  31.07.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5692	    6.5208</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.1825	    2.1765</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.3050	    4.2940</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3985	    3.3705</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5034	    0.5031</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7336	    0.7335</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2724	    0.2721</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8464	    6.8464</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6883	    0.6886</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.1556	    1.1550</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
